  "description": "DNG Lettings present this well presented two bed semi-detached house in the exclusive Stratford Haven development in Rathgar Village. The property has a brand new modern kitchen and bathroom, new rear patio garden and a bright modern living room. There is 2 large double bedrooms and a new bathroom. Brand new furniture and wooden floors throughout. The property benefits from 1 x parking space and is a private secure development. \nThe location is a major attraction, with Rathgar and the surrounding areas offering an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. There are also a number of highly regarded schools in the surrounding area, while the property is well positioned for access to Dublin city centre and the many amenities of Dublin 6.\n",
